## Model card (from meta — specs curated, benchmarks unverified)

- **Name:** Hy3 (Hunyuan)
- **Short description:** Tencent's open-weight Hunyuan MoE (295B total / 21B active) with 256K context and hybrid fast-and-slow thinking, Apache 2.0 licensed; the full July-2026 release (preview in `../hy3-preview/`).
- **Provider / access:** Tencent; TokenHub preview; OpenCode Zen `tencent/hy3`. No Zen Free ID.
- **Context window:** 256,000 (256K) / 32K out.
- **Modalities:** text + image in; text out.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-03):** TokenHub preview ~$0.18/$0.59 per 1M.
- **Architecture:** 295B total / 21B active open-weight MoE.

